msgid "The interface rejected bus monitor mode: another client holds a connection to it."
msgstr "Rozhranie odmietlo režim monitora zbernice: iný klient s ním udržiava spojenie."

msgid "The bus monitor connects the interface in bus monitor mode. The normal connection is closed while the bus monitor runs: nothing can be sent or downloaded in that time. Stopping the bus monitor restores the normal connection.\n\nStart the bus monitor?"
msgstr "Monitor zbernice pripojí rozhranie v režime monitora zbernice. Kým monitor zbernice beží, normálne pripojenie je ukončené: v tomto čase sa nedá nič odosielať ani nahrávať. Zastavením monitora zbernice sa normálne pripojenie obnoví.\n\nSpustiť monitor zbernice?"

msgid "Start Bus Monitor"
msgstr "Spustiť monitor zbernice"

msgid "The bus monitor connection could not be established."
msgstr "Spojenie monitora zbernice sa nepodarilo nadviazať."

msgid "The normal connection is restored."
msgstr "Normálne pripojenie je obnovené."

msgid "The interface does not support bus monitor mode."
msgstr "Rozhranie nepodporuje režim monitora zbernice."

msgid "The bus monitor is not supported for this connection type. It needs a tunnelling connection."
msgstr "Monitor zbernice nie je pre tento typ pripojenia podporovaný. Vyžaduje tunelovacie pripojenie."

